ng combat, they will shout {{overhead|Stand and deliver!}}, causing their next attack to have increased accuracy.{{Fact}} They appear to be wielding a [[steel scimitar]] with a recoloured handle.\n\nOutlaws are not recommended for training [[combat]] skills on, as they only provide 1/40th of the amount of experience that regular monsters would. This, however, can be used to train combat skills while remaining at a low [[Hitpoints]] level.\n\n==Locations==\n{{LocTableHead}}\n{{LocLine\n|name = Outlaw\n|location = West of the [[Grand Exchange]]\n|levels = 32\n|members = No\n|mapID = 0\n|plane = 0\n|x:3116,y:3473|x:3117,y:3477|x:3118,y:3470|x:3118,y:3474|x:3119,y:3472|x:3119,y:3477|x:3121,y:3471|x:3123,y:3473|x:3123,y:3477|x:3124,y:3476\n|mtype = pin\n|leagueRegion = Misthalin\n}}\n{{LocTableBottom}}\n\n==Drops==\n{{DropLogProject|kills=51773}}\n===100%===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Bones|quantity=1|rarity=Always}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Rat's paper|namenotes={{(m)}}|quantity=1|rarity=Always|raritynotes=<ref group=d>Rat's papers are only dropped during [[What Lies Below]].</ref>|gemw=No}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n{{Reflist|group=d}}\n\n===Armour===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Bronze med helm|quantity=1|rarity=2/128}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Runes===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Mind rune|quantity=9|rarity=2/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Water rune|quantity=6|rarity=2/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Earth rune|quantity=5|rarity=2/128}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Herbs===\n{{HerbDropTableInfo|32/128}}\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{HerbDropLines|32/128}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n\n===Coins===\n{{DropsTableHead}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Coins|namenotes={{(f)}}|quantity=10|rarity=32/128|raritynotes=<ref group=d>Only dropped in [[free-to-play]]</ref>}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Coins|quantity=5|rarity=12/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Coins|quantity=15|rarity=4/128}}\n{{DropsLine|name=Coins|quantity=25|rarity=1/128}}\n{{DropsTableBottom}}\n{{Reflist|group=d}}\n\n===Other===\n{{DropsTableHea